examples DelveTalk 1
case requester receives work after the actual claimant submits
law requester moss iris
as iris
send post
  task: Cannot impersonate the requester.
expect refusal: source refused: Only the requester can post nonempty work from draft.
as requester
send post
  task: Describe the moth wing.
expect committed
as moss
send claim
expect committed
as iris
send submit
  result: Not my claim.
expect refusal: source refused: Only the claimant can submit nonempty work.
as moss
send submit
  result: The wing is aligned.
expect committed
as requester
send accept
  review: Description received.
expect committed
as requester
send reject
  review: A terminal review cannot be replaced.
expect refusal: source refused: Only the requester can review a submission.
case rejection records review without claiming an external effect
law requester moss
as requester
send post
  task: Examine a second wing.
expect committed
as moss
send claim
expect committed
as moss
send submit
  result: It needs another pass.
expect committed
as requester
send reject
  review: Try another technique.
expect committed
observe main
  title: Work ticket · Rejected
  prose: Try another technique.
expect view
